# prime 1.0.0 output contract (before the BILL-153 failure).
# kind[@Section] | a | b | message
section | Existing capabilities to reuse | | the brief must say what already exists
section | Architecture facts that constrain the design | | constraints need evidence
section | Dependencies and blast radius | | callers and schema that the change reaches
section | Open questions | | unknowns go to the plan checkpoint, not into guesses
min-count@Existing capabilities to reuse | `[^`]*/[^`]*` | 1 | every reuse row names a path
min-count@Architecture facts that constrain the design | `[^`]*/[^`]*` | 1 | every constraint names its evidence path
max-count | \S | 80 | a brief fits on one screen
forbid | ^(First|Then|Next),? I\b | | the brief narrates the exploration instead of reporting findings
